    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_020"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whaaaat?! The main door...! My god, what kind of monster are you\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cronin's Bodyguard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Goooaaaaaaaal!;......;Friends, you mustn't be so rude to the courier.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_290_vigna"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hehe, I've always wanted to give that a try. And now, there's this line...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vigna"
    },
    {
        "text": "Um, ahem!",
        "tag": "name",
